Package: pacha
Title: Reproducible Reporting for ChecklistBank Ethnobotanical Data
Version: 0.1.0
Authors@R: person("Marcelo F.", "Amores-Palma", role = c("aut", "cre", "cph"),
    email = "contacto.envinatu@gmail.com",
    comment = c(ORCID = "0000-0002-0337-0467"))
Description: Provides programmatic access to the 'Listado de plantas de
    uso y aprovechamiento sostenible en Ecuador' <doi:10.48580/dgvrn>.
    Acts as a client for the 'ChecklistBank' API and for processing
    'ColDP' (Catalogue of Life Data Package) files. Supports data
    retrieval for ethnobotanical records and includes built-in
    Markdown report generation for reproducible workflows.
